# Byte budgets in the rubric are measured on the shipped bytes, and core.autocrlf
# is true on the build machine. Without this, a fresh checkout rewrites v2.css to
# 25,140 B (cap 24,576) and v2.js to 14,915 B (cap 14,592) purely from line endings,
# and both budgets read as failing on a tree nobody edited. Pin the shipped text to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
